        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "with a lower prevalence of isoniazid resistance comes with some uncertainty. Second, there",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.96337890625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "are potential differences in the mutations present in isoniazid monoresistant strains and MDR",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.7794799804688,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "strains; that is, some studies suggest that the mutations found in monoresistant strains are more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9464693069458,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.0195922851562,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "diverse than the mutations found in MDR strains. Third, although the population for this PICO",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.969970703125,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "question is “irrespective of rifampicin resistance”, enrolment criteria in the studies meant that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.6766357421875,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "most participants within the included studies had RR-TB. As a result of these concerns, certainty",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970561027526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        527.1614379882812,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "of evidence was downgraded one level for indirectness both for sensitivity and specificity, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998250007629395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        504.69891357421875,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the quality (certainty) of evidence was rated moderate both for sensitivity and specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.447509765625,
        504.6540832519531,
        219.53550720214844
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 2.4.1.1 Forest plot of included studies for isoniazid resistance detection,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.8475341796875,
        517.0619506835938,
        233.93553161621094
      ],
      "text": "irrespective of rifampicin resistance with culture-based phenotypic DST as the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.3475341796875,
        178.8541259765625,
        249.43553161621094
      ],
      "text": "reference standard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.2682189941406,
        526.5003051757812,
        391.0232238769531
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; DIAMA: Diagnostics for Multidrug Resistant Tuberculosis in Africa; DST: drug susceptibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.0682067871094,
        526.5274047851562,
        401.8232116699219
      ],
      "text": "testing; FIND: Foundation for Innovative New Diagnostics; FN: false negative; FP: false positive; TB: tuberculosis;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.86822509765625,
        210.4021453857422,
        412.62322998046875
      ],
      "text": "TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.6315002441406,
        526.87890625,
        442.7765197753906
      ],
      "text": "The sensitivity in these three studies ranged from 81% to 100% and the specificity from 87% to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969256401062012,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.1315002441406,
        527.1968994140625,
        458.2765197753906
      ],
      "text": "100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 94.2% (95% CI: 89.3–97.0%) and the pooled specificity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.7854919433594,
        244.12710571289062,
        473.6994934082031
      ],
      "text": "was 98.0% (95% CI: 95.2–99.2%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.5830078125,
        523.2432861328125,
        499.6709899902344
      ],
      "text": "PICO 2: Should low complexity automated NAATs be used on sputum in people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        499.9830322265625,
        522.5029296875,
        514.071044921875
      ],
      "text": "with signs and symptoms of pulmonary TB, irrespective of resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        514.383056640625,
        524.4528198242188,
        528.4710693359375
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin, for detection of resistance to fluoroquinolones, as compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        528.7830200195312,
        320.2106018066406,
        542.8710327148438
      ],
      "text": "with culture-based phenotypic DST?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.573974609375,
        527.0029296875,
        566.718994140625
      ],
      "text": "Three multinational studies with 1337 participants provided data for evaluation of detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.073974609375,
        524.41357421875,
        582.218994140625
      ],
      "text": "of fluoroquinolone resistance. The reference standard for each of these studies was culture-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.573974609375,
        527.1572875976562,
        597.718994140625
      ],
      "text": "based phenotypic DST. Each study centre in the multinational studies was analysed as a separate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.073974609375,
        165.8719024658203,
        613.218994140625
      ],
      "text": "study ( ). Fig. 2.4.1.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.077880859375,
        527.2288208007812,
        637.222900390625
      ],
      "text": "Specificity estimates were inconsistent, at 84% (FIND, Mumbai), 91% (FIND, New Delhi) and more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.577880859375,
        526.9666748046875,
        652.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "than 96% for other studies. The heterogeneity in specificity estimates could not be explained.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.077880859375,
        526.986572265625,
        668.222900390625
      ],
      "text": "Consequently, the certainty of the evidence was downgraded one level for inconsistency; the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.577880859375,
        520.1206665039062,
        683.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "quality (certainty) of the evidence was rated high for sensitivity and moderate for specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "74 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
